exports[`02-tables-wrapping.md: plain, 40 columns 1`] = `
"A table too wide for the screen, so
cells wrap:

Command: configuration
What it does: Reads and validates the
settings file
Notes: Looks in
$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/example/ first, then
falls back to the home directory
───────────────────────────────────────
Command: serve
What it does: Starts the local server
Notes: Listens on port 8080 unless
--port is given
───────────────────────────────────────
Command: synchronise
What it does: Pulls changes from the
remote
Notes: Runs the hooks in
~/.config/example/hooks/ before and
after, if there are any
───────────────────────────────────────
Command: completions
What it does: Prints shell completion
scripts
Notes: Supports bash, zsh and fish;
other shells may work but are not
tested

One cell long enough to need more than
four lines, which switches to the
vertical layout:

Name: alpha
Description: This description is
deliberately very long so that at a
normal terminal width the cell has to
wrap onto more than four lines, and
the renderer gives up on the box
layout and prints each row as header
and value pairs instead. It keeps
going for a while to make sure that
happens even on a wide screen with
plenty of room for the text to spread
out.
───────────────────────────────────────
Name: beta
Description: short

Many columns, so even the longest words
don't fit and words get cut:

Identifier: production-eu-west
Environment: kubernetes
Configuration: helm-values
Deployment: progressive
Observability: opentelemetry
Authentication: oauth2-pkce
Authorization: rbac-policies
Localization: translations

Wide characters (CJK and emoji take two
columns each):

┌──────────┬────────────┬──────┐
│ Language │  Greeting  │ Mood │
├──────────┼────────────┼──────┤
│ Japanese │ こんにちは │ 😀   │
├──────────┼────────────┼──────┤
│ Chinese  │ 你好       │ 🎉🎉 │
├──────────┼────────────┼──────┤
│ Polish   │ Cześć      │ 👍   │
└──────────┴────────────┴──────┘"
`;

exports[`02-tables-wrapping.md: plain, 80 columns 1`] = `
"A table too wide for the screen, so cells wrap:

┌───────────────┬───────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────────────┐
│    Command    │   What it does    │                  Notes                   │
├───────────────┼───────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────────┤
│               │ Reads and         │ Looks in $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/example/       │
│ configuration │ validates the     │ first, then falls back to the home       │
│               │ settings file     │ directory                                │
├───────────────┼───────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ serve         │ Starts the local  │ Listens on port 8080 unless --port is    │
│               │ server            │ given                                    │
├───────────────┼───────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────────┤
│               │ Pulls changes     │ Runs the hooks in                        │
│ synchronise   │ from the remote   │ ~/.config/example/hooks/ before and      │
│               │                   │ after, if there are any                  │
├───────────────┼───────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────────┤
│               │ Prints shell      │ Supports bash, zsh and fish; other       │
│ completions   │ completion        │ shells may work but are not tested       │
│               │ scripts           │                                          │
└───────────────┴───────────────────┴──────────────────────────────────────────┘

One cell long enough to need more than four lines, which switches to the
vertical layout:

Name: alpha
Description: This description is deliberately very long so that at a normal
terminal width the cell has to wrap onto more than four lines, and the
renderer gives up on the box layout and prints each row as header and value
pairs instead. It keeps going for a while to make sure that happens even on a
wide screen with plenty of room for the text to spread out.
────────────────────────────────────────
Name: beta
Description: short

Many columns, so even the longest words don't fit and words get cut:

┌──────────────┬───────┬─────────┬───────┬─────────┬─────────┬────────┬────────┐
│              │ Envir │ Configu │ Deplo │ Observa │ Authent │ Author │ Locali │
│  Identifier  │ onmen │ ration  │ yment │ bility  │ ication │ izatio │ zation │
│              │   t   │         │       │         │         │   n    │        │
├──────────────┼───────┼─────────┼───────┼─────────┼─────────┼────────┼────────┤
│ production-e │ kuber │ helm-va │ progr │ opentel │ oauth2- │ rbac-p │ transl │
│ u-west       │ netes │ lues    │ essiv │ emetry  │ pkce    │ olicie │ ations │
│              │       │         │ e     │         │         │ s      │        │
└──────────────┴───────┴─────────┴───────┴─────────┴─────────┴────────┴────────┘

Wide characters (CJK and emoji take two columns each):

┌──────────┬────────────┬──────┐
│ Language │  Greeting  │ Mood │
├──────────┼────────────┼──────┤
