exports[`06-inline.md: plain, 40 columns 1`] = `
"Emphasis: bold, italic, bold italic,
~~strikethrough~~, bold with italic
inside.

Code spans: npm install, code with \`
backtick, and a < b && c > d.

Links:

- Inline: \x1B]8;;https://code.claude.com\x07Claude Code\x1B]8;;\x07
- With a title: \x1B]8;;https://example.com\x07example\x1B]8;;\x07 ("Example
  title")
- Bare URL: \x1B]8;;https://github.com/bibixx\x07https://github.com/bibixx\x1B]8;;\x07
- Angle brackets: \x1B]8;;https://example.org\x07https://example.org\x1B]8;;\x07
- Link text equal to the URL:
  \x1B]8;;https://example.com\x07https://example.com\x1B]8;;\x07
- Email: someone@example.com
- Mailto with text: write to me
  (someone@example.com)
- Code that is a URL:
  https://example.com/path

Image: alt text
(https://example.com/image.png)

Escapes: *not italic*, \`not code\`, # not
a heading, 1. not a list.

Entities: &amp; &lt; &gt; &copy; and a
non-breaking space.

Inline HTML:
<kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>C</kbd> and <b>bold
tag</b>.

Issue reference: see #123 and
bibixx/md#4.

<!-- An HTML comment, shown in grey -->"
`;

